### ClinicFinder API – account requests
### VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each request.
### Run in order: the tokens from sign-up / sign-in are reused by the requests below them.

@base = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### Health check (API + database)
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Reference data for the forms (specialties, governorates + cities, insurances, blood types, languages)
GET {{base}}/lookups

########## PATIENT ##########

### Create a patient account -> 201 { token, user }
# @name patientSignup
POST {{base}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nadine Khalil", "email": "nadine@example.com", "phone": "03 123 456",
  "password": "Secret#123", "acceptTerms": true }

### Invalid data -> 422 with every problem listed
POST {{base}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "N", "email": "not-an-email", "phone": "123", "password": "weak", "acceptTerms": false }

### Same email again -> 409
POST {{base}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Nadine K", "email": "NADINE@example.com", "phone": "71 123 456",
  "password": "Secret#123", "acceptTerms": true }

### Sign in as the patient
# @name patientLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "nadine@example.com", "password": "Secret#123" }
### Step 2: health profile (ids come from GET /lookups) -> onboarding = done
PUT {{base}}/patients/me/health-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{patientLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "dob": "1990-05-14", "cityId": 2, "bloodTypeId": 1, "insuranceId": 1, "insuranceNumber": "NS-4411",
  "allergies": ["Penicillin"], "noKnownAllergies": false }

### Change part of the health profile later
PATCH {{base}}/patients/me/health-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{patientLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "insuranceId": null }

### My patient account
GET {{base}}/patients/me
Authorization: Bearer {{patientLogin.response.body.token}}

########## DOCTOR ##########

### Create a doctor account -> 201, verification = pending
# @name doctorSignup
POST {{base}}/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lina Khoury", "email": "lina@clinic.lb", "phone": "+961 71 222 333", "password": "Secret#123",
  "specialtyId": 2, "licenseNumber": "18342", "cityId": 2, "acceptTerms": true }

########## SIGN IN ##########

### Wrong password -> 401 (same message as an unknown email)
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@clinicfinder.lb", "password": "wrong" }

### Administrator (account created by npm run db:seed)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@clinicfinder.lb", "password": "Change-Me-Now#2026", "remember": true }

### Who am I?
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

########## ADMIN: DOCTOR APPLICATIONS ##########

### Pending applications
GET {{base}}/doctors?verification=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### One application
GET {{base}}/doctors/{{doctorSignup.response.body.user.doctor.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### Approve
PATCH {{base}}/doctors/{{doctorSignup.response.body.user.doctor.id}}/verification
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "approved" }

### Reject (a reason is required)
PATCH {{base}}/doctors/{{doctorSignup.response.body.user.doctor.id}}/verification
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "rejected", "reason": "The license number does not match the Order's register." }

########## ADMIN: USERS ##########


### List users (filters: role, status, search, page, pageSize)
### List users
# @name listUsers
GET {{base}}/users?role=patient&search=nadine
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

GET {{base}}/users/{{listUsers.response.body.$.items[0].id}}

### One user
GET {{base}}/users/{{patientLogin.response.body.user.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### Suspend (reason required) – the user is signed out at once
PATCH {{base}}/users/{{patientLogin.response.body.user.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "suspended", "reason": "Repeated no-shows" }

### Reactivate
PATCH {{base}}/users/{{patientLogin.response.body.user.id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "active" }

### Delete -> 204 (409 if the account has appointments or prescriptions: deactivate it instead)
DELETE {{base}}/users/{{patientLogin.response.body.user.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

########## MY ACCOUNT (any role) ##########

### My account
GET {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorSignup.response.body.token}}

### Update my settings
PATCH {{base}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{doctorSignup.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "language": "fr", "notifications": { "sms": true } }
